&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our ambition is to attract the very best diverse talent to Ogilvy, and to be the employer of choice in the UK. We want everyone to feel welcome when they join us, and once they’re here, for them to want to stay with us, grow their career, and to feel they belong with us. &lt;/li&gt;
