&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a Junior Data Engineer to join the team that&amp;nbsp;maintains&amp;nbsp;our trades &amp;amp; emissions dataset and the ingestion pipeline that feeds it. This is the data at the heart of our product: every customer brings their own trade and supply chain data, in their own formats and with their own quirks, and turning it into reliable, carbon-accounted insight is what this team does.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is an early-career role with a strong emphasis on learning.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work on well-defined tasks with supervision — ingesting customers&#39; data, writing SQL to investigate and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;it, and making fixes and improvements to the pipeline — while building fluency with our data, our tooling, and modern engineering practices.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;develop deep domain&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in supply chain and commodity trade data that very few engineers in the industry have.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
