&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-performing candidate to join our Marketing team as a Senior Product Marketing Manager. This person must have experience at high-growth technology companies and will be responsible for defining the value proposition of their product line and creating collateral and sales enablement tools. We are looking for someone who quickly grasps changing customer needs, market trends, and the competitive landscape, and is passionate about communicating product value to the marketplace. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your role as a Senior Product Marketing Manager, you will be an expert in buyers, how they buy, their buying criteria and will transfer that knowledge across multiple internal teams. Success in the role requires strong communication skills, a strategic mindset, a deep understanding of the product marketing discipline, of Jamf products, the market, competition, Apple products and the ability to inspire and effectively collaborate with marketing, product management, product strategy, engineering, sales and other customer-facing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is &lt;span class=&quot;searchHighlight&quot;&gt;remote&lt;/span&gt; in the UK. We are only able to accept applications for those based in the UK or have sponsorship to live and work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect to do in this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging – develop insight-driven product positioning and messaging that differentiates&amp;nbsp;Jamf&amp;nbsp;in the market in collaboration with other teams. Consistently refine positioning based on market feedback&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement – communicate the Jamf value proposition across multiple products to internal teams and develop tools that support the needs of&amp;nbsp;those teams for customers, including sales pitch decks, sales training, and outreach content.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product launch – coordinate the market launch of product releases and manage the cross-functional implementation of the plan. Consistently evaluate launch success and adjust approach based on market feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness and demand generation – collaborate with marketing to influence, drive and support marketing programs that build awareness and drive demand  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assets – Create product and industry-related marketing assets such as white papers, collateral, videos, case studies, presentations, blog/social topics, and more in collaboration with the marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence - be the expert on the market, our market segments, the buyers – including personas, how they buy and their buying criteria – and our competition. Be seen as the subject matter expert for this intelligence and share it regularly.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events – support and present at&amp;nbsp;Jamf&amp;nbsp;events, webinars, industry events and internally to educate, build awareness and position&amp;nbsp;Jamf. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration – build strong relationships with product strategy, product management, marketing, sales/account management team, customer&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;and other internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis - Synthesizes data from a variety of sources to produce and communicate a compelling vision for QBRs, board meetings, marketing planning, etc. and&amp;nbsp;participates&amp;nbsp;in executive strategy sessions &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive projects - Manage strategic, highly visible, cross-functional projects that&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;Jamf’s&amp;nbsp;business. Examples include launching a new software tool, win/loss&amp;nbsp;program or a new customer advisory board.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyst relations - Build relationships with key market analysts, conduct briefings and secure favorable mentions of&amp;nbsp;Jamf&amp;nbsp;in analyst publications. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product marketing experience &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of general marketing experience at a B2B technology company &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with key internal teams and customers to assess and define market needs &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical,&amp;nbsp;quantitative&amp;nbsp;and problem-solving skills &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert communicator (written and verbal) and ability to clearly articulate technical information in a straightforward and compelling manner &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong public speaker with&amp;nbsp;demonstrated&amp;nbsp;success presenting in a variety of formats to large audiences &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills. Anticipates and solves conflicts or dependencies with project deadlines and deliverables.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the Apple ecosystem &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record&amp;nbsp;of success driving outcomes across organizations with multiple stakeholders &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand target audiences and address their pain points/challenges &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and results-oriented &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership and team-building skills &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video editing tools (Camtasia, Screenflow, etc.) &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Apple tools Keynote and Pages &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
